Bendyline Knowledge - repository and dataset licenses

1. General license and scope
============================

The MIT License below applies to Bendyline's original pipeline code, original
project documentation, and original dataset metadata, unless a more specific
license is identified. Imported catalog content and adaptations of that content
retain their applicable source licenses. The MIT grant does not replace them.

The per-catalog list in section 2 identifies the applicable licenses and notices.
It describes catalogs registered in the source repository; a listing does not
mean that a compiled release has been published. For a particular release, use
the license texts, attribution, source revisions, and notices shipped with that
release. Later changes to this overview do not change earlier release licenses.

